Description: Provides an R interface to the Beagle software for genotype phasing 
 and imputation. This package allows users to run Beagle directly from R, 
 supporting genotype data in VCF, CSV, or TXT formats. It includes options to set 
 Beagle's phasing and imputation parameters and handles the conversion of genotype 
 data to VCF format when necessary.
